0000:                   * ------------------------------------------------------------------
0000:                   *   5      1998/10/12  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Taken from OS-9 L2 Tandy distribution and modified banner for V3.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *   5r2    2003/01/08  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Fixed fork behavior so that if 'shell startup' fails, system doesn't
0000:                   * jmp to Crash, but tries AutoEx instead.  Also changed /DD back to /H0
0000:                   * for certain boot floppy cases.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *          2003/09/04  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Back-ported to OS-9 Level One.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *   5r3    2003/12/14  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Added SHIFT key check to prevent startup/autoex from starting if
0000:                   * held down.  Gene Heskett, this Bud's for you.
0000:                   
